{"seq":1,"slug":"shaping-modern-management","title":"Shaping Modern Management","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/influence-and-legacy/shaping-modern-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-on-business","title":"塑造现代企业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/influence-and-legacy/shaping-modern-management/influence-on-business","wordCount":2035,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-management-guru","title":"大师中的大师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/influence-and-legacy/shaping-modern-management/the-management-guru","wordCount":1592,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现德鲁克对现代管理的塑造。他全方位地塑造了现代企业——从经营理念（顾客导向、创新）、到组织管理（分权管理、目标管理）、到对&quot;人&quot;的重视，现代企业的理念与实践都深深地打着德鲁克的烙印。他被誉为&quot;大师中的大师&quot;——不仅深刻地影响了无数的管理者、企业家，更深刻地影响、启迪了无数其他的管理大师，是现代管理学的泰斗与思想源泉。本章揭示德鲁克在管理思想界的崇高地位。</p>\n"}